# Generated by `node tools/polestar.js profession gathering build` from data/forever and tools/lib/professions/gathering. Do not edit: rebuild with that command.
guide forever/professions/fishing
title Fishing 1-300
category Professions
coords era
levels 5-60
zone Ironforge

# Fishing 1-300 for both factions. Every catch can raise the skill wherever you
# fish; low skill only makes fish get away in harder waters, so each band sends
# you to water near where you level (fishing-pool clusters from objects.json,
# or the shore where water creatures live). Expert Fishing is a book sold by
# Old Man Heming in Booty Bay; Artisan Fishing is Nat Pagle's quest in
# Dustwallow Marsh (four rare fish).
#
# Spawns, trainers and vendors come from the Era baseline (pfQuest); recipes and
# their skill colours from the Forever client tables (`profession build`).
# Nothing confirms the spawns' 10-60 placement on Forever yet: refine with
# Polestar_Recorder sessions. Waypoints are Era-frame (`coords era`); the engine
# converts them where Forever changed a map frame.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Apprentice

step Learn Fishing
  tip Any Fishing trainer of your faction teaches Apprentice Fishing (character level 5); the arrow picks the nearest. Buy a Fishing Pole from a trade goods or fishing vendor and equip it.
  level 5
  train Fishing Apprentice
  buy 6256 x1 nearest

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Fishing 1-75

