# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Expert Fishing

step Expert Fishing
  tip Expert Fishing (cap 225) is a book, not a trainer rank: Old Man Heming sells Expert Fishing - The Bass and You in Booty Bay, at the south tip of Stranglethorn Vale, to both factions. Buy it and read it; it needs skill 125 and level 20.
  level 20
  train Fishing Expert "Buy and read Expert Fishing - The Bass and You (Expert Fishing)"

