# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Artisan Fishing: Nat Pagle

step Nat Pagle, Angler Extreme
  only Alliance
  zone Ironforge
  tip Artisan Fishing (cap 300) comes from Nat Pagle in Dustwallow Marsh. The fishing trainer in Ironforge sends you to him; the quest needs skill 225 and level 35.
  skill Fishing 225
  level 35
  accept 6609                             -- Grimnur Stonebrand, Ironforge

step Nat Pagle, Angler Extreme
  only Horde
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Artisan Fishing (cap 300) comes from Nat Pagle in Dustwallow Marsh. The fishing trainer in Orgrimmar sends you to him; the quest needs skill 225 and level 35.
  skill Fishing 225
  level 35
  accept 6608                             -- Lumak, Orgrimmar

step Nat Pagle
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  tip Nat Pagle fishes from the shore of a small island off the east coast, south of Theramore.
  turnin 6609 only Alliance
  turnin 6608 only Horde
  accept 6607

step Sar'theris Striker
  zone Desolace
  tip Fish in Sar'theris Strand, the north-west coast of Desolace (Slitherblade naga shore) until you catch a Sar'theris Striker; it only bites there.
  collect 16968 quest 6607 @33.0,22.4

step Feralas Ahi
  zone Feralas
  tip Fish in the Verdantis River in Feralas until you catch a Feralas Ahi; it only bites there.
  collect 16967 quest 6607

step Savage Coast Blue Sailfin
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip Fish in the Savage Coast, the north-west shore of Stranglethorn Vale until you catch a Savage Coast Blue Sailfin; it only bites there.
  collect 16969 quest 6607 @22.0,17.3

step Misty Reed Mahi Mahi
  zone Swamp of Sorrows
  tip Fish in the Misty Reed Strand, the south-east shore of Swamp of Sorrows until you catch a Misty Reed Mahi Mahi; it only bites there.
  collect 16970 quest 6607 @86.5,84.0

step Nat Pagle
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  turnin 6607                             -- Artisan Fishing

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Fishing 225-300

step Fishing: Stranglethorn Vale (225-300)
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip Fish the pools along the coast here (eels, snappers, wreckage) until skill 300. Booty Bay sells bait and Nightcrawlers for a small fishing bonus.
  goto 27.5,76.5 "Booty Bay coast" r 25
  skill Fishing 300
